### Koleksi Uji REST API Perpustakaan (Pertemuan 4)
### Gunakan ekstensi REST Client di VS Code atau editor sejenis

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000/api

### 1. LOGIN ADMIN (Mendapatkan Bearer Token)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@perpus.test",
  "password": "password"
}

### Simpan token dari respons di atas
@adminToken = {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 2. LOGIN ANGGOTA
# @name anggotaLogin
POST {{baseUrl}}/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "email": "anggota1@perpus.test",
  "password": "password"
}

### Simpan token anggota
@anggotaToken = {{anggotaLogin.response.body.token}}

### 3. AMBIL PROFIL USER YANG SEDANG LOGIN (GET /api/me)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 4. KATALOG BUKU PUBLIK (Tanpa Token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?per_page=5
Accept: application/json

### 5. PENCARIAN BUKU DENGAN FILTER
GET {{baseUrl}}/books?search=Laravel&available=1
Accept: application/json

### 6. DETAIL BUKU
GET {{baseUrl}}/books/1
Accept: application/json

### 7. DAFTAR KATEGORI
GET {{baseUrl}}/categories
Accept: application/json

### 8. DAFTAR PENULIS
GET {{baseUrl}}/authors
Accept: application/json

### 9. BUAT PEMINJAMAN BARU (Anggota)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{anggotaToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "book_ids": [1, 2]
}

### 10. LIHAT DAFTAR PINJAMAN ANGGOTA (Hanya data miliknya)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans
Authorization: Bearer {{anggotaToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 11. UJI IDOR: Anggota mencoba membuka pinjaman orang lain (Harus 403 Forbidden)
GET {{baseUrl}}/loans/2
Authorization: Bearer {{anggotaToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 12. PENGEMBALIAN BUKU (Petugas/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/1/return
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "returned_at": "2026-11-20"
}

### 13. PELUNASAN DENDA (Petugas/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/loans/1/pay-fine
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 14. TAMBAH KATEGORI BARU (Petugas/Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "name": "Kecerdasan Buatan & Data Science",
  "description": "Buku-buku seputar Machine Learning, AI, dan Python Data"
}

### 15. HAPUS KATEGORI YANG MEMILIKI BUKU (Uji Integritas FK Restrict -> 409 Conflict)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/categories/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### 16. LOGOUT API (Mencabut Token)
POST {{baseUrl}}/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json
